# WIP 1 — Windigitaly AI Lead Conversion Copilot

## 1. Project Overview

WIP 1 focuses on developing the initial prototype of an AI-assisted Lead Conversion Copilot using Lovable.

The prototype is designed to help manage business enquiries, organize leads, monitor their sales pipeline, and identify follow-up actions.

## 2. Development Platform

- Platform: Lovable
- Project: Windigitaly AI — Lead Conversion Copilot
- Version: 1.0 Prototype

