## 4. Main Features Developed

### A. Overview Dashboard
- Displays total leads.
- Shows leads requiring follow-up.
- Tracks qualified and won leads.
- Displays recent leads.
- Shows lead status distribution.
- Recommends next actions.

### B. Lead Management
The prototype includes lead records with business names, service requirements, enquiry sources, priority levels, and sales statuses.

### C. AI Assistant
An AI Assistant section is included in the navigation for enquiry analysis and lead assistance.

### D. Message Studio
A dedicated Message Studio section is included for managing lead communication.

### E. Insights
An Insights section is included to support the review of lead pipeline performance.

### F. Settings and Guide
A separate section is included for application settings and usage guidance.

