## 6. Prototype Technology and Limitations

The displayed Version 1 prototype uses local rules and templates. It does not use external AI, and the dashboard states that data stays in the browser.

Therefore, this stage demonstrates the interface and initial lead-management concept rather than a fully integrated AI automation system.

## 7. Outcome

WIP 1 established the initial user interface and functional concept for a Lead Conversion Copilot. It provided the foundation for further development of enquiry analysis, lead management, follow-up support, and automation.
